      "source": [
        "# 🏢 UrbanInsight v3 Enhanced — Multi-City Building Detection & Georeferencing\n",
        "## Based on: Khatua et al. (GISTAM 2024) + SpaceNet + Anti-Overfitting Best Practices\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### 📋 What's New in v3 Enhanced:\n",
        "\n",
        "| Feature | Implementation |\n",
        "|---------|----------------|\n",
        "| **5-City Training** | Vegas, Paris, Shanghai, Khartoum, Rio — unique seed per city |\n",
        "| **Georeferencing** | Automatic extraction & transfer of geospatial info (GDAL) |\n",
        "| **Building Segmentation** | YOLOv8-seg with pixel-accurate masks |\n",
        "| **Vector Polygons** | Automatic shapefile generation with geographic coordinates |\n",
        "| **JSON Metadata** | Per-building detection with ID, area, confidence, type |\n",
        "| **External Testing** | FMOW dataset validation (no training leakage) |\n",
        "| **Anti-Overfitting** | Frozen backbone (3 epochs), dropout, weight decay, lower LR |\n",
        "| **Data Leakage Detection** | Automated verification of train/val/test splits |\n",
        "| **Checkpoint Safety** | Save every 5 epochs + recovery mechanism |\n",
        "| **Per-City Metrics** | Individual evaluation for each city |\n",
        "\n",
        "### 🎯 Target Metrics (from Khatua et al. Table 1):\n",
        "- **YOLOv8-seg**: Precision 0.944 | Recall 0.892 | mAP 0.945 | Inference 400ms\n",
        "- **Our Target**: ≥0.944 precision, ≥0.892 recall, ≥0.945 mAP"
      ],
      "id": "UrbanInsight_Enhanced_Title"
    },
